{"sha": "f9a5438f155dc88391260af0b66cd99499e857e6cfbd1ab99c78edabeaeba889", "body": ["\\emph{极小化：}$f(x,y) = x^2 + y^2 + (x + 2y - 4)^2$。记", "$w = x + 2y - 4$ 为最后一个因子：", "\\[", "\\nabla f = \\bigl(2x + 2w,\\; 2y + 4w\\bigr) = 0", "\\iff x = -w \\text{ 且 } y = -2w .", "\\]", "代入 $w$ 的定义：$w = -w - 4w - 4$，于是 $w =", "-\\frac23$，从而 $x = \\frac23$，$y = \\frac43$，且 $z = w =", "-\\frac23$。与投影所得为同一点，距离为", "$\\sqrt{\\frac49 + \\frac{16}{9} + \\frac49} = \\frac{2\\sqrt 6}{3} =", "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt6}$；这是极小值点，因为在无穷远处 $f \\to \\infty$", "（正定二次项与线性项之和）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:9}", "记 $\\rho = \\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$，有 $\\frac{\\partial \\rho}{\\partial x} =", "\\frac{x}{\\rho}$，于是", "\\[", "\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x} = \\varphi'(\\rho)\\,\\frac{x}{\\rho},", "\\qquad", "\\frac{\\partial^2 f}{\\partial x^2}", "= \\varphi''(\\rho)\\,\\frac{x^2}{\\rho^2}", "+ \\varphi'(\\rho)\\,\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{\\rho} -", "\\frac{x^2}{\\rho^3}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "（由商法则与链式法则）。将关于 $y$ 的对称表达式相加：", "$\\varphi''$ 项合并得 $\\frac{x^2 + y^2}{\\rho^2} = 1$，", "$\\varphi'$ 项合并得 $\\frac{2}{\\rho} - \\frac{x^2 +", "y^2}{\\rho^3} = \\frac{1}{\\rho}$：", "\\[", "\\Delta f = \\varphi'' + \\frac{\\varphi'}{\\rho} .", "\\]", "径向调和函数：求解 $\\varphi'' + \\frac{\\varphi'}{\\rho} = 0$，即", "一阶方程 $u' + \\frac u\\rho = 0$，令 $u = \\varphi'$，", "解得 $u = \\frac{c}{\\rho}$（见\\cref{thm:b1:diffeq:homogeneous1}），", "再积分得 $\\varphi = c\\ln\\rho + d$。径向调和函数为", "$c\\,\\ln\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} + d$ --- 即", "\\cref{exo:b1:multivar:7} 中的对数位势与常数，别无其他。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:10}", "对 $z = xy$ 在 $(1,1)$ 处：偏导数为 $y = 1$ 与 $x = 1$，切", "平面为 $z = 1 + (x - 1) + (y - 1) = x + y - 1$。水平", "切平面意味着两个偏导数同时为零，即 $\\nabla f = 0$：", "由\\cref{ex:b1:multivar:extrema}可知，恰为临界点", "$(0, 0)$ 与 $(1, 1)$，对应水平切平面 $z = 0$ 与 $z =", "-1$。“水平切平面”与“临界点”", "是同一概念，分别在图形与公式中呈现。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:11}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 固定 $y$，一元函数 $x \\mapsto", "        f(x,y)$ 在 $\\R$ 上导数恒为零，从而为常值函数", "        （见\\cref{thm:b1:derivative:mvt}）：$f(x, y) = f(0, y)$ 对", "        所有 $x$：$f$ 只依赖于 $y$。", "  \\item 设 $g(u, v) = f\\bigl(\\frac{u+v}2, \\frac{u-v}2\\bigr)$。", "        由链式法则（见\\cref{thm:b1:multivar:chain}，", "        对变量 $v$ 应用，视 $u$ 固定）：", "        \\[", "        \\frac{\\partial g}{\\partial v}", "        = \\frac12\\,\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}", "        - \\frac12\\,\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y} = 0 .", "        \\]", "        由 (1)，$g$ 只依赖于 $u$：$g(u, v) = \\varphi(u)$", "        其中 $\\varphi$ 为 $C^1$ 类函数，并逆用", "        变量代换（$u = x + y$，$v = x - y$），", "        \\[", "        f(x, y) = \\varphi(x + y).", "        \\]", "        反之，每个这样的 $f$ 均满足 $f_x = f_y =", "        \\varphi'$：所有解恰为 $C^1$ 类函数，", "        其自变量为 $x + y$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:12}", "在开圆盘内，极值点必为临界点：$\\nabla f = (y,", "x) = 0$ 仅在 $(0,0)$ 处成立，此处 $f = 0$；它是鞍点（$f(\\pm", "\\varepsilon, \\pm\\varepsilon) = \\varepsilon^2 > 0 > -\\varepsilon^2", "= f(\\pm\\varepsilon, \\mp\\varepsilon)$），故该点不取极值。由", "在本阶段不加证明地承认的最值定理可知，上下界均可取到，", "且必在边界圆周上取到。在边界上，借助", "\\cref{exo:b1:multivar:5}，", "\\[", "f(\\cos t, \\sin t) = \\cos t\\sin t = \\frac{\\sin 2t}{2}", "\\in \\intcc{-\\tfrac12}{\\tfrac12},", "\\]", "最大值 $\\frac12$ 在 $t = \\frac\\pi4, \\frac{5\\pi}4$ 处取得（即点", "$\\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(1,1)$），最小值 $-\\frac12$ 在 $t =", "\\frac{3\\pi}4, \\frac{7\\pi}4$ 处取得（即点 $\\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(1,-1)$）。", "全局最大值为 $\\frac12$，全局最小值为 $-\\frac12$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:multivar:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 展开右边：", "\\[", "r\\Bigl(h + \\frac srk\\Bigr)^{\\!2} + \\frac{rt - s^2}{r}k^2", "= rh^2 + 2shk + \\frac{s^2}{r}k^2 + \\frac{rt - s^2}{r}k^2", "= q(h,k) .", "\\]", "若 $rt - s^2 > 0$：两个平方项都带有 $r$ 的符号因子，", "且 $q(h,k) = 0$ 迫使 $k = 0$，进而 $h = 0$，故", "除原点外严格取 $r$ 的符号。若 $rt - s^2 < 0$：$q(1, 0) = r$，而", "$q\\bigl(-\\frac sr, 1\\bigr) = \\frac{rt - s^2}{r}$ 的符号与之", "相反：两种符号均会出现。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 若 $r = 0 \\neq t$，交换 $h$ 与 $k$ 的角色", "（对 $k$ 配方），结论相同；注意", "$rt - s^2 = -s^2 < 0$ 只要 $s \\neq 0$ 即成立，且 $q =", "2shk + tk^2$ 此时取两种符号（$k$ 相对 $h$ 很小）。若", "$r = t = 0$：$q = 2shk$，两种符号均出现，当且仅当 $s \\neq 0$，亦即", "$rt - s^2 = -s^2 < 0$。小结：$q$ 取两种符号 $\\iff rt -", "s^2 < 0$；$q$ 仅在原点处为零（定号）$\\iff rt -", "s^2 > 0$（这蕴含 $r \\neq 0$，因 $r = 0$ 时 $q(1,0) =", "0$）。", ""]}